# Random faults on the BW-1 (P8d): how one is vetted, and what its Brief asks.
# AD 0 3 0 0 DA A 9 +: the digits at power-on, after the address, the byte and the +.
machine bw1
task "Pick an address with AD, change its byte with DA, go on with +."
press SW17:100ms:150ms
press SW1:200ms:250ms
press SW4:300ms:350ms
press SW1:400ms:450ms
press SW1:500ms:550ms
press SW18:600ms:650ms
press SW11:700ms:750ms
press SW10:800ms:850ms
press SW19:900ms:950ms
capture 80ms
capture 580ms
capture 880ms
capture 1000ms
